### Crear orden de taller — 200
### Reemplazar los publicId por GUIDs reales de la cuenta (unidad, vehículo,
### taller y proveedor de repuestos de sparePartProviders).
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/createWorkshopOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitPublicId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "vehiclePublicId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "workshopPublicId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "orderDate": "2026-08-20T09:00:00",
  "invoiceId": "FAC-2026-0001",
  "currencyId": 1,
  "odometer": 55000,
  "orderId": "OT-2026-0001",
  "sparePartProviderPublicId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "filePublicIds": null,
  "workshopEntryDate": "2026-08-20T08:00:00",
  "workshopExitDate": "2026-08-20T17:00:00",
  "maintenanceTypeId": 1
}

