### Validación: unitPublicId con GUID inválido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/createWorkshopOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitPublicId": "no-es-un-guid",
  "vehiclePublicId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "workshopPublicId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "orderDate": "2026-08-20T09:00:00",
  "currencyId": 1,
  "odometer": 55000
}

### Unidad/taller inexistente (RAISERROR del SP) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/createWorkshopOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitPublicId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999",
  "vehiclePublicId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999",
  "workshopPublicId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999",
  "orderDate": "2026-08-20T09:00:00",
  "currencyId": 1,
  "odometer": 55000
}
